{
    "background_story": "Hottie was a majestic thoroughbred with a refined palate. As a prized possession of the esteemed Oakwood Stables, she was known for her discerning taste in the finest grains and hay. Her owner, a renowned equine connoisseur, spared no expense in providing Hottie with the best of everything. She would snub her nose at anything less than the highest-quality oats, and her trainer would often joke that she had a more refined palate than most humans. Hottie's love for the finer things in life extended beyond her diet; she was also a connoisseur of comfort, insisting on the plushest blankets and the most luxurious grooming sessions. Her discerning nature made her a standout in the equestrian world, and she was sought after by top breeders and trainers for her impeccable taste and breeding.",
